# T_SCRE: an item's notes edited in the memo editor and saved, the save
# answered "-ERR 404" (the session wants a password change): the
# message, then the editor, the form and the list left for the login.
# The next command opens the item list again, and the same path after
# the new login gets the same answer, which the login armed again.  The
# third login arms it for the Parts tab of a copy of item 1 (Ctrl-D, then
# Parts): the screens are left for the login with no note of the copy
# pending, as the last command, which shows a pending note, finds.
K ENTER CTRL-E PGDN F4
T Lost line.
K CTRL-S
S MUSTCHG
K ENTER
S AGAIN
K ENTER CTRL-E PGDN F4
T Lost line.
K CTRL-S
S MUSTCHG2
K ENTER
K CTRL-D
S COPY
K ALT-C P
S MUSTCHG3
K ENTER
S NONOTE
K ESC
